                            <p class="h6 my-3 heading-regular">Once you are confirmed as a Participant in the Program, you may earn Infinity Rewards points, as provided below, when you transact using your ABC banking credit card. Once you earn a certain number of points, you may be eligible to redeem benefits and rewards applicable to that number of points, which benefits may change from time to time and may be offered on a limited basis.</p>
